      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JETPACK (3) has had three runs this prep and is yet to finish in the top three. Added to the sequence last time over 2130m at this track, finishing 24 metres away from the winner in fifth. A nice draw on the front line should ensure a cosy run. Meets a comparable field and he can discover winning ways. EXPRESSING (7) produced a good effort at her latest run to get home by a narrow margin over 2100m at Bunbury on July 28. Must overcome a very wide draw. Big chance in a similar assignment. GAME ON GIRLS (8) broke last start and finished a distant last over 2130m at this track when making her first appearance. The driver has some work to do from this wide starting position. Won't find this any harder and she can bounce back. THE VITRUVIAN MAN (2) is worth another chance after a last-start eighth over 1609m at Bunbury three-and-a-half weeks ago.",
